71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YWjylm4e018Q7kNvwGdh8cK&_nc_oc=AdppowvH82A1zPirH3bq_pfc00R6w0fOEJEmN_6s6k8ie4qKEtT0vbxc7F9d5h1cH4g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAQe9bB1SRr1QZPVRR3UtHJ93W8phBTJqbF2OuajiouzA&oe=6A490639"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hAQ1pB0gIBIQ7kNvwEhblt4&_nc_oc=Adq0BKG5leS6nBSJScwuqTpTjStn6oZ-7d7nw5Iia4xSCRszLPiPczWVeN9X5CU7DI8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAXnxjLwXR4rNUIWhjMTENxGz-FGmN-V4G3MOF_VTAcnQ&oe=6A491913"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=95sGrkrbCwsQ7kNvwGf4DQQ&_nc_oc=AdpI4ECbpecaid0uR_2GWTA6kqZw93O7f_tD98V7CmTP02NYSdhSy0TrYH5SNlduu7k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC7qeggKegF5pdrXijj6eb6XceTiW6A8h-i5qDTDIEQiw&oe=6A49175A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: